<p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="background-image: none; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-position: 0% 0%; background-clip: border-box; background-origin: padding-box; background-size: auto auto;">{!Contact.FirstName} {!Contact.LastName}:<br></span></span></font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Our records indicate that you are currently 30 days past due
on your Housing rental payments.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Failure
to pay monthly rent is a violation of your license agreement and may impact
your ability to renew the agreement for the upcoming (semester/year).<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>In addition, residents who become 60 or more
days past due will have their license agreement immediately cancelled and will
be removed from University housing.</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">In order to remain in University Housing on the Polytechnic
Campus, you need to pay <u><span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">$XXX.XX</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">
by</span></u></font><u><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><span style="background-image: none; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-position: 0% 0%; background-clip: border-box; background-origin: padding-box; background-size: auto auto;"> </span></font></span></u><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="background-image: none; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-position: 0% 0%; background-clip: border-box; background-origin: padding-box; background-size: auto auto;"><u><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">1 week after the date of this letter</span></u>.</span></span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;
</span><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">You may submit payment via mail by check payable to ASU University
Housing, Attn:<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Lorrie Woesner,
 PO Box
870212, Tempe, AZ 85287-0212 or in person at the Polytechnic Cashiering
Services located in Quad 2, where<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;
</span>acceptable forms of payment include cash or checks only.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>You may also pay online through your ASU
student account; using MasterCard, Discover or American Express.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span></font><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">If you feel this message has reached you in error, please
send an e-mail addressing your concerns to <a href="mailto:Lorrie.Woesner@asu.edu">Lorrie.Woesner@asu.edu </a>or call
480-727.8273.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Make sure to include the
name of the primary license holder, their affiliate ID, campus address and
specific information regarding your concerns.</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Sincerely,</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

